# Whitelist approach: /home/super holds ~81GB of unrelated data (propdata,
# Documents, Images, opencv_src, ...). Ignore everything at the top level, then
# re-admit only the project's own files.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/*.py
!/*.sh
!/*.md
!/faces/

# generated output, caches, snapshots of built geometry
__pycache__/
*.pyc
tek_out/
.cache/
*.npz
*.png
*.mp4
*.log
